    {
      "id": "claim_833130df020a4e6ab07864de59278881",
      "statement": "`/model` selection is per chat: an operator may choose a credentialed provider-catalog model or the default; the saved choice applies on the next turn and across `/new` and restarts without changing other chats, while scheduled jobs and subagents retain their configured or startup models.",
